# AI-Powered Help System & Chatbot — Implementation Plan

## Goal

Build a **100% local, self-contained AI help system and chatbot** for ModApp using **ONNX models running entirely on-server**. No cloud APIs, no external dependencies, no data leaving the server. Every page gets a contextual help button; a floating chatbot with a local LLM guides users step-by-step through any workflow.

**Core AI Stack (all local):**
- **Semantic Search**: `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` ONNX model (23 MB) — sentence embeddings for document retrieval
- **Text Generation**: `Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct` ONNX model (INT4 quantized, ~2.5 GB) — local LLM for conversational responses
- **Intent Classification**: ML.NET `SdcaMaximumEntropy` — lightweight text classifier

