## Design Decisions (All Resolved)

| Question | Decision | Rationale |
|----------|----------|-----------|
| **AI Backend** | **100% Local ONNX** — no cloud APIs | Self-contained product. No API keys, no recurring costs, no data privacy concerns. Phi-3-mini ONNX for generation + MiniLM for embeddings. |
| **Multi-language** | **English-only** | Consistent with project-wide `i18n is a non-goal` decision |
| **User Feedback** | **Yes** — thumbs up/down | Minimal cost, enables ranking improvement and gap identification |
| **Content Authoring** | **Both** — auto-ingest markdown + Admin UI CRUD | 700+ files auto-indexed, admins can add/edit via UI |
| **Fallback** | **Template engine** when LLM model not present | System works for retrieval+templates even without the 2.5 GB model download |

